msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 RX2 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-stellarf4.rst:63 0d22a30892d94ff5a46f92b18953b6fa
#: 41c34c06d63a48c286bea8c0f138976c 85afb17cd7604a7daf5e98008e8c9d42
#: c283dc296330488bb561bc475ce43fbe e681493ed4e644c0990f374585fb7b1d
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX2 connection, in addition to RX2, and automatically "
"provides telemetry."
msgstr "CRSF 除需要 RX2 外还需要 TX2 连接，并自动提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-stellarf4.rst:64 0fd9d9562d5740fe8d59e735d2444efa
#: 4f412bd0a6f34cf19cbf3ddd5fd961f6 77effa8773254aee9a9d4a23922f1984
#: a5bf78e301b14bd89b0a24fb6fb1e0d5 bf5da036778b46a39fa14874308eb21a
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX2 and :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>`"
" set to \"7\". See :ref:`common-FPort-receivers`."
msgstr ""
"FPort 需要连接到 TX2，并将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设为 \"7\"。参见 "
":ref:`common-FPort-receivers`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-stellarf4.rst:65 04a0a5acd4f3435d9cf2f6e8009c673d
#: 22a32e4964734507a68f638597ce3c75 bef6c47ffe974d97a4ac50410e50af89
#: e0e7c20416ed470191259a0f9b1ad778 f5746039ae604ed7bb7488bf9d4ee02e
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX2 and automatically provides telemetry. Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` to “4”."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 TX2，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设为 “4”。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-stellarf4.rst:68 016d0c22f2e540888fbdf5a7e4b735fc
#: 0d0c3fe285fb4500840c1793a54cad88 412c73cfd95b406694ea8bba81015c28
#: 6c817c98ac05497bb1fb61488288c991 a192c9a3ec66427da7e4a93253b7e527
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-stellarf4.rst:69 0fc6687350684f29981d98671edbb705
#: 57cfbd6ec6fa4aaaaf7ee7757850868c 7f8598ac81f7481fa04bb8079a35065b
#: 89f8df14fbc643248d380b378aecc0aa fbd7393e05414f8bb16d664524927168
msgid ""
"StellarF4 supports using its internal OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver)."
" External OSD support such as DJI or DisplayPort can be used simultaneously "
"and is preconfigured on SERIAL3 but can be supported on any spare UART. See "
":ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2` for more info."
msgstr ""
"StellarF4 支持使用其内置 OSD，设置 OSD_TYPE 为 1（MAX7456 驱动）。DJI 或 DisplayPort 等外部 OSD "
"可同时使用，已预配置在 SERIAL3 上，也可在任何空闲 UART 上支持。更多信息参见 :ref:`common-msp-osd-"
"overview-4.2`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-stellarf4.rst:73 0f154916422e4f44a170861a55366495
#: 3ab13fdbc0224b539586273a222f7dad 665c11bc1b1b41918406a8f61a7db1f8
#: ad59137f0ba742dfba91b8b3b79ecfe4 e071f4f9d9b246898692ea2dfb110492
