msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-stellarf4.rst:74 23924484fa8b4b16a59dcf8b6b8838f3
#: 2b3c6a2d66e34de383a8b6d68e8bcbb2 c39cdfeaffa14414810eaffbe5aa992f
#: d8cd229f5d084f7ea12a6a384626c8b8 f3321937f61b415e8bec1ad4c2bfb60e
msgid ""
"StellarF4 supports up to 10 PWM/Dshot outputs. PWM1-4 outputs support Bi-"
"Directional DShot."
msgstr "StellarF4 支持最多 10 路 PWM/DShot 输出。PWM1-4 输出支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-stellarf4.rst:76 8461fbb11197422d8d0f612c05fd5c8f
#: 88a633e2feaa43eda34e923eb6ae8917 96cd216f0fee4fada0d87e15631f7936
#: d85e2fbfd21f45cba354a71550fc25c1 f3ba4700971f473cbb783d13ec427f48
msgid ""
"Channels 1-4 support bi-directional DShot. Channels 1-8 marked as M1-M8 on "
"the board. Channels 9-10 marked as S1-S2 on the board. PWM outputs are "
"grouped and every group must use the same output protocol:"
msgstr ""
"通道 1-4 支持双向 DShot。通道 1-8 在板上标为 M1-M8。通道 9-10 在板上标为 S1-S2。PWM "
"输出分组，每组必须使用相同的输出协议："

